    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the dimly lit sub-basement of the abandoned Blackwood Research Facility. Dust motes dance in the flickering light of emergency backup generators, and the air smells faintly of ozone and old paper. The facility went dark decades ago after a mysterious experiment, leaving behind a complex web of interconnected analytical machines. In the center of the room sits the Final Decryptor, your only hope of uncovering Dr. Blackwood's last message and overriding the lockdown. You must trace the intricate flow of data through these forgotten devices, powering them up in the correct sequence to extract the ultimate secret before the backup generators fail completely.",
    "narrative_style": "mystery"
  },
